%N A391448 Numbers k such that sigma(k) = psi(k) + phi(k) + Omega(k)^5.
%e A391448 43960 is a term since sigma(43960) = 113760 = 91008 + 14976 + 6^5 = psi(43960) + phi(43960) + Omega(43960)^5.
%o A391448 (PARI) isok(k) = {my(f = factor(k)); sigma(f) == prod(i=1, #f~, (f[i, 1]+1) * f[i, 1]^(f[i, 2]-1)) + eulerphi(f) + bigomega(f)^5;} \\ _Amiram Eldar_, Feb 19 2026
